Environment: macOS 27.0 arm64; Node v25.9.0; pnpm 11.19.0; no API credential required.

Implementation:
- `team-run` defines the optional `TeamDelegationDriver` capability and, after durable parent cancellation intent is accepted, awaits the selected coalesced delegation drive before releasing local ownership or reporting cancellation.
- `team-delegation` implements and registers that capability through an effect-scoped owner registry; the existing event-driven drive remains the source of work and duplicate drives coalesce. The seam is not a new public `Context` service.
- A TeamRun regression holds the driver open and proves the coordinator lease is not disposed before the child-saga drive settles.

